tabi is participating in Steam Next Fest! Let cute creatures and your typing avatar keep you company while you work, create, stream, or even play through your long list of Next Fest games. The demo is available on Windows and Mac! Your feedback really helps us to improve the game, so feel free to leave us a review on Steam and join our Discord to chat and discuss together!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:23:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943050-1846651706679990","game_id":"steam-4943050","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is now available on Mac!","summary":"Hey Workmates,Working With Montabi Demo is now available on Mac! We’ve always wanted to bring Mac support from the get go and we’re happy to finally make it happen!Just in time before Steam Next Fest, you can now work with adorable creatures, type along with your avatar, and customize your workspace all at your own pace. If you've tried the demo, feel free to let us know what you think and leave us a review on Steam. Every bit of feedback means a lot to us! You can also join our Discord to discu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:58:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679990","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943050-1846018067941087","game_id":"steam-4943050","kind":"announcement","title":"Working With Montabi demo is now available ahead of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey Workmate,Working With Montabi demo is now available!You can now try Working With Montabi while you create, play, or browse your screen!When you put an item in your room, Montabi will visit your room and keep you company. You can collect every Montabi at your own pace without worrying about scams or bots because there’s no marketplace trading.If you’re lucky, you might get gifts from the Montabi visitors to customize your room and avatar. You can also use various tools like to-do list and Pom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:14:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941087","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943050-1846018067932835","game_id":"steam-4943050","kind":"announcement","title":"Working With... Snarky Companion?","summary":"Hey Workmate, Have you ever wanted to work with…A charmingly snarky companion who thrives in mischief and seems a little too happy in concerning situations? New crossover coming from the Institute to your room this October. Stay tuned for Working With Montabi demo release soon and join our Discord to stay updated!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T10:27:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943050-1846018067925658","game_id":"steam-4943050","kind":"announcement","title":"Working With... Delivery Companion?","summary":"Hey Workmate, Have you ever wanted to work with…A curious little companion who enjoys delivering food and loves cardboard boxes more than any fancy toys?New crossover coming from the kitchen to your room this October. Stay tuned for Working With Montabi demo release soon and join our Discord to stay updated!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:15:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925658","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943050-1843481262691875","game_id":"steam-4943050","kind":"announcement","title":"First Playtest Signup is Open!","summary":"Hey Workmates,We just announced Working With Montabi a few days ago and now we’re opening our first playtest! If you want to try working with Montabi in our new desktop companion, you can sign up for the playtest here.Also join our Discord to stay updated on everything Montabi, discuss with the community, and working together with Montabi!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T11:11:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943050-1842846814452100","game_id":"steam-4943050","kind":"announcement","title":"New Desktop Companion Announced: Working With Montabi","summary":"Hey Workmates,Meet a new desktop companion: Working With MontabiWe’re introducing Working With Montabi, a new desktop companion where cute creatures visit your room while you work. A New Montabi ExperienceThis game is set in the same universe as our previous game, Montabi! While we continue to support Montabi with new updates, Working With Montabi offers a different experience to interact with the creatures. Familiar companions return alongside new creatures, this time in a cozy space that accom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T03:37:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452100","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4943050":{"last_attemp